%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: Regular polygon using repeat - Chapter 5
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments

72 72 scale
4.25 5.5 translate
1 72 div setlinewidth
/make-regular-polygon { 4 dict begin
  /N exch def
  /A 360 N div def
  1 0 moveto
  N {
    A cos A sin lineto
    /A A 360 N div add def
  } repeat
  closepath
end } def
newpath
5 make-regular-polygon
stroke
showpage
%%EOF
